Z||000000||TheFiero64||04-16-2000||10:32 AM||||&lt;&lt;This was posted by Ray Paulk on the fiero list&gt;&gt;<P>(NEFA it's the new Fiero club, "New England Fiero Association", launched March 11th)<P>Date: August 26, 2000 - 8:00 AM 'til ??<P>This flea market and swap meet is to be held at Kick Hill Farms, home of Bob Parker, perhaps the largest  source for used Fiero parts anywhere. Imagine a 3 decker barn filled with Fiero parts and you have free reign to wander, hunt and search where ever you want. Then you go out back and, after steering around the Huey Helicopter Bob is rebuilding, you find 3 trailers full of parts and the old stock yards full of Fiero body panels, frames, cradles, etc. Of course then there's the old tennis courts with the yet to be disassembled Fieros lay in waiting.<BR>And if that's not enough, there's all the people bringing in parts, I'll be there with my Fiero Toy Box full of of Fiero toys, plus literature and other memorabilia.<P>This is the premiere Fiero candy store! The best place to buy, sell or<BR>trade anything to do with a Fiero!!!<P>Come join us on August 26th. Starts at 8:00 AM. Owner's cars will be<BR>displayed on the mowed field beside Bob's house. (parts from these cars<BR>are taken at your own risk!)<P>For those traveling in, we will reserve a block of rooms at a local<BR>Motel. We'll have something going on for Friday PM and a common meeting<BR>place for Sunday morning breakfast and good-byes. Of course Foxwoods and the Mohegan Sun casinos aren't far away either.<P>For more info contact the New England Fiero Association Event<BR>Directors..<P>Eric Schneck, at &lt;eschneck@bigfoot.com&gt;<BR>or<BR>Greg Bedard at &lt;greg@sniff.shr.dec.com&gt;<P><p>[This message has been edited by TheFiero64 (edited 04-18-2000).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||Old Lar||04-17-2000||08:54 PM||||Does Bob still have his petting zoo? August is a long way off, but keep publishing the date so that we can all plan for the trip.||||reg||10
Z||000002||Gokart||04-17-2000||09:01 PM||||I can't wait just so I can get back into Bob's barn again! That place is AMAZING!||||reg||14
